      '<li>The first <b>5</b> gear levels count like gem levels: spells ×' + (G.DamageGrowth || 1.19) + ', attacks <b>×' + (G.BonusLevelAttackMore || 1.06) + '</b> more each.</li>' +
      '<li>Past +5: spells and minion gems grow ×1.16, ×1.13, ×1.10, then ×1.08 a level (patch notes 6 Nov, unchanged in 0.56.7); attacks only ×1.01 a level. So stacking gear levels pays off most for spells and minions.</li>' +
      '<li>Mana cost goes up with gem level too. Each card\'s second row shows levels ' + (max + 1) + '–' + (max + 20) + '; past ' + (max + 5) + ' it is the sim\'s reading of the patch notes, not yet checked against the game.</li>' +
      '</ul></details>';
